    },
    "setup": [
     "A letter in handwriting you know from team sheets. {vet.name} is out of football.",
     "{if arc.told>=1}\"I talk in schools now, about the betting. I always tell them about a lad who sat in my car and said we're going to the gaffer.\"{/if}",
     "{if arc.told==0}\"They wiped my debt in the end. I don't know if it was worth it. I think about the penalty. I expect you do.\"{/if}"
